WEBVTT

00:03:59.436 --> 00:04:01.316
In the city, the same is true.

00:04:01.356 --> 00:04:04.236
There are differences
inside the administration,

00:04:04.276 --> 00:04:05.636
between departments

00:04:05.676 --> 00:04:07.276
and between agency,

00:04:07.316 --> 00:04:09.876
which each have their own targets

00:04:09.876 --> 00:04:14.156
and own responsibility
unrelated to climate,

00:04:14.196 --> 00:04:16.316
and their own budget to stick to.

00:04:16.676 --> 00:04:22.356
This makes it very difficult
to coordinate climate measures

00:04:22.396 --> 00:04:26.076
which often cross sectoral boundaries.

00:04:26.076 --> 00:04:30.316
Our a solution to this fragmentation